---
import Logo from './icons/Logo.astro';
import LogoWithText from './icons/LogoWithText.astro';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-6">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <nav class="glass-card flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 md:px-7">
      <LogoWithText size="38" />

      <div class="hidden items-center gap-7 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--ink-muted)] md:flex">
        <a href="#experience" class="transition hover:text-[var(--navy)]">Experience</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="transition hover:text-[var(--navy)]">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#roadmap" class="transition hover:text-[var(--navy)]">Roadmap</a>
      </div>

      <a href="#pricing" class="premium-cta-secondary text-sm">Join the beta</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="section-shell relative py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="hero-glow left-[5%] top-[15%] h-44 w-44 bg-[rgba(123,208,215,0.22)]"></div>
    <div class="hero-glow right-[7%] top-[12%] h-52 w-52 bg-[rgba(246,203,104,0.22)]"></div>

    <div class="story-grid items-center gap-14">
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <span class="section-kicker">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--angel-deep)]"></span>
          Financial conscience, not just expense tracking
        </span>

        <h1 class="mt-7 max-w-3xl font-heading text-5xl font-extrabold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.04em] text-[var(--ink-strong)] md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
          Spend with a little more
          <span class="relative mx-2 inline-flex">
            <span class="rounded-[24px] bg-[rgba(246,203,104,0.34)] px-3 py-1 text-[var(--navy)]">
              conscience
            </span>
          </span>
          and a lot less autopilot.
        </h1>

        <p class="section-copy mt-7 max-w-2xl">
          Conscia brings impulse, reason, and reflection into one budgeting flow. Ask before you buy,
          log what happened after, and let the app spot the patterns you keep repeating.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="#pricing" class="premium-cta-primary">
            Start with the free plan
          </a>
          <a href="#experience" class="premium-cta-secondary">
            See the product flow
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="glass-card px-4 py-4">
            <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">Before</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
              Ask your conscience before an impulse becomes a transaction.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-card px-4 py-4">
            <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">During</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
              Log quickly with smarter suggestions, voice, and category memory.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-card px-4 py-4">
            <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">After</div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
              Reflect on regret, hesitation, and the habits underneath both.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -left-2 top-20 hidden w-56 rounded-[24px] border border-[rgba(23,36,79,0.08)] bg-white/92 p-4 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] lg:block">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="chip-devil">Impulse</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--devil-deep)]">Tempted</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
            “It’s just one upgrade. You’ll use it every day.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute -right-3 bottom-14 hidden w-60 rounded-[24px] border border-[rgba(23,36,79,0.08)] bg-white/92 p-4 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] lg:block">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="chip-angel">Reason</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--angel-deep)]">Budget-aware</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
            “You’ve already spent 72% of your fun budget. Wait until next week.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="device-frame">
          <div class="device-screen">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">Pre-Purchase Assistant</div>
                <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--ink-muted)]">A conversation before the swipe</div>
              </div>
              <Logo size="42" />
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6 rounded-[26px] border border-[rgba(23,36,79,0.08)] bg-white p-4 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
                <span>Thinking about</span>
                <span class="chip-gold">PHP 6,400</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink-strong)]">
                A weekend gaming splurge
              </div>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="chip-devil">Gaming</span>
                <span class="chip-gold">Fun money</span>
                <span class="chip-angel">Higher confidence</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4">
              <div class="rounded-[24px] bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(165,47,40,0.1),rgba(246,203,104,0.12))] p-4">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="chip-devil">Impulse</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--devil-deep)]">
                    persuasive
                  </span>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-strong)]">
                  “You’ve been talking about this upgrade for weeks. It’s not random if it still feels
                  exciting after payday.”
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="rounded-[24px] bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(27,143,159,0.12),rgba(123,208,215,0.18))] p-4">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="chip-angel">Reason</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--angel-deep)]">
                    grounded
                  </span>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-strong)]">
                  “It would move Gaming from 44% to 78% this month. Not disastrous, but it narrows your
                  breathing room fast.”
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 mock-card p-4">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">Budget impact</div>
                  <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Gaming budget would move to 78%</div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[var(--navy)]">78%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-meter mt-4">
                <span class="bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,var(--angel-deep),#5abca3)]" style="width: 78%"></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold">
              <div class="rounded-[20px] bg-[rgba(23,36,79,0.06)] px-4 py-3 text-[var(--navy)]">
                Ask something else
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-[20px] bg-[var(--navy)] px-4 py-3 text-white">
                Bought it anyway
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
